2043	/*--------------------------------------
2044	 * report if P|n or P|n+2 for P from prime[]
2045	 *
2046	 * rely on n*(1/P) <= limit(P) <=> P divides n
2047	 * we check (n*(1/P) <= limit(P)) and ((2*n+1)*(1/P) <= limit(P)) by
